Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want out of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the widow you got the head and destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a week, then I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you a letter from the airport saying where to find the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can do what you like with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can give it to the widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or blackmail her, like I'm doing to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your ambitions are.
